 The provider defaults to off; general ATen registration remains with FlagGems.
 
+### DeepSeek V4.1 text serving on MetaX
+
+The V4.1 text integration uses the V2 runner, the `deepseek_v41` tokenizer,
+and the `deepseek_v4` reasoning parser. Its checkpoint has row-channel INT8
+weights and dynamic per-token INT8 activations; designated Engram and indexer
+paths retain their checkpoint-specific mixed precision. KV cache uses
+`fp8_ds_mla`. This entry covers text generation on two nodes with eight MetaX
+C550 devices each, TP8/PP2 and FULL graphs. Vision, tool calling, speculative
+MTP and other hardware/topologies are outside this entry's support scope.
+
+The integration requires the accompanying FlagGems and FlagGems-vllm changes,
+including the public fused insert API's `apply_q_norm=False` capability.
+Fixed public dependency revisions are pending; the base image alone does not
+provide this integration. Do not replace the installed vLLM or select another
+source tree with `PYTHONPATH`.
+
+On each node, set `MODEL_PATH`, `VLLM_HOST_IP`, `MASTER_ADDR`, `NODE_RANK`
+(0 or 1), `COMM_IFACE`, `HCA_LIST`, `GID_INDEX` and `RDMA_PROVIDER_PREFIX`
+for the verified local deployment. The RDMA provider must match its driver ABI.
+Launch rank 0 first, then rank 1; only rank 0 serves HTTP:
+
+```bash
+export VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 USE_FLAGTUNE=0
+export MCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME="$COMM_IFACE" GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME="$COMM_IFACE"
+export MCCL_IB_HCA="$HCA_LIST" MCCL_IB_GID_INDEX="$GID_INDEX"
+export MCCL_IB_DISABLE=0 MCCL_CROSS_NIC=1 RDMAV_DRIVERS="$RDMA_PROVIDER_PREFIX"
+headless=()
+if [[ "$NODE_RANK" == 1 ]]; then headless=(--headless); fi
+vllm serve "$MODEL_PATH" --served-model-name DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-W8A8-Text \
+    --tokenizer-mode deepseek_v41 --reasoning-parser deepseek_v4 \
+    --tensor-parallel-size 8 --pipeline-parallel-size 2 --nnodes 2 \
+    --node-rank "$NODE_RANK" --master-addr "$MASTER_ADDR" --master-port 29621 \
+    --distributed-executor-backend mp --dtype bfloat16 --quantization fl_w8a8_int8 \
+    --kv-cache-dtype fp8_ds_mla --block-size 64 --kv-cache-memory-bytes 536870912 \
+    --max-model-len 50000 --max-num-batched-tokens 1024 --max-num-seqs 16 \
+    --async-scheduling --enable-prefix-caching \
+    --compilation-config '{"cudagraph_mode":"FULL"}' "${headless[@]}"
+```
+
+After the coordinator is ready, run the standard-library client with
+`python examples/deepseek_v41_client.py`, or add `--thinking` for reasoning
+output. Its `--base-url`, `--model` and `--prompt` arguments select the service
+and input. The tokenizer defaults to thinking with high effort when no explicit
+chat-template override is provided; the example sets this choice explicitly.
+The 50k context, batch and cache budgets above are a bounded deployment profile,
+not a claim that the checkpoint's full advertised context has been validated.
+
